### Commit via RESPOND inside TRANSACTION
POST /ledger

{"id": 1, "label": "Invoice", "amount": "125.50"}
=> 201

{"saved": true}

### Rollback when HTTPERROR escapes TRANSACTION
POST /ledger/fail

{"id": 2, "label": "Ghost", "amount": "999.99"}
=> 400

{"error": "ROLLED BACK"}

### Only the committed row exists, with DECIMAL serialized as string
GET /ledger
=> 200

{"entries": [{"id": 1, "label": "Invoice", "amount": "125.50"}]}
